  "description": "A Playwright download handler for Scrapy.Net (like scrapy-playwright): requests marked with meta \"playwright\" are rendered in a headless Chromium, Firefox or WebKit, with page actions (click, fill, scroll, wait for selector, evaluate, screenshot), resource blocking and page reuse; other requests keep using plain HTTP. Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios, dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil.",
