  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0: [ScrapyItem] source-generated item accessors and NativeAOT support; crash-safe disk queue for JOBDIR; HTTP/3 (DOWNLOAD_HTTP_VERSION); spider contracts and scrapynet check; Gravicode.ScrapyNet.Redis for distributed crawling; pgvector and Azure AI Search vector stores and Microsoft.Extensions.AI adapters; the Scrapy.Net Console (web admin) in Gravicode.ScrapyNet.Server. See https://github.com/DotNetVibeCoderz/Vibe_Library/blob/main/ScrapyNet/Progress.md",
